  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "OnDegraded": "Continue",
  "Description": "Conversation with Personal Status: a conversation with a machine that takes the personal status of the person into account. The Multimodal Frontend Description gives what the microphone and the camera deliver as Speech, Face, Body and other Visual Objects and the Visual Scene Descriptors; Visual Instance Identification gives the Identifiers of the Visual Instances; Automatic Speech Recognition gives the Recognised Text; Natural Language Understanding understands the Text with the Identifiers; Personal Status Extraction gives the Personal Status of the person from the Face, Body, Speech and Text; Entity Dialogue Processing gives the Machine Text and the Machine Personal Status; Portable Avatar Multiplexing gives the Portable Avatar.",
